        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Experience a cinematic, story-driven FPS where destruction is your greatest weapon.</strong><br>In <i>Empty Space: The Creator</i>, you play as <strong>Sara</strong>, a woman who wakes after a mysterious car crash, only to find herself trapped in a surreal world of her own making. As she navigates this haunting realm, she must confront the consequences of what she created… and try to escape it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This isn't just another shooter. It's a <strong>fully destructible, emotionally charged experience</strong> built for players who crave atmosphere, intensity, and meaning.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎬 <strong>Cinematic Storytelling</strong><br>Immerse yourself in a gripping narrative with high quality visuals and music, combining rich atmosphere and sci-fi in a way only bold indie games dare to explore.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧱 <strong>Total Environment Destruction</strong><br>Nearly every object, wall, and building can be blown apart. Use destruction creatively in combat. but beware: debris can harm you too.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900500/extras/28bbbc1b4ad5fbfb0db6f2c5651207c5.poster.avif?t=1757942072\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900500/extras/28bbbc1b4ad5fbfb0db6f2c5651207c5.webm?t=1757942072\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900500/extras/28bbbc1b4ad5fbfb0db6f2c5651207c5.mp4?t=1757942072\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⚔️ <strong>Epic Boss Battles</strong><br>Each boss fight is dynamic, unforgettable, and evolves the environment as you play. <strong>No reused ideas</strong>, no filler, just handcrafted moments that keep you on edge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900500/extras/59023439271812d44011a3d518e0a337.poster.avif?t=1757942072\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900500/extras/59023439271812d44011a3d518e0a337.webm?t=1757942072\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900500/extras/59023439271812d44011a3d518e0a337.mp4?t=1757942072\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎮 <strong>A Love Letter to Single Player Games</strong><br>Forget bloated open worlds with nothing to do. <i>Empty Space: The Creator</i> focuses on <strong>tight design</strong>, <strong>meaningful content</strong>, and <strong>pure player immersion</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900500/extras/53f7b93ad58c02bd7000ab0943e59956.poster.avif?t=1757942072\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900500/extras/53f7b93ad58c02bd7000ab0943e59956.webm?t=1757942072\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900500/extras/53f7b93ad58c02bd7000ab0943e59956.mp4?t=1757942072\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>If you’ve been missing the golden era of single-player shooters, this is for you.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready to explore. Destroy. Survive. And uncover the truth behind Sara’s digital prison.</p></li></ul>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Experience a cinematic, story-driven FPS where destruction is your greatest weapon.</strong><br>In <i>Empty Space: The Creator</i>, you play as <strong>Sara</strong>, a woman who wakes after a mysterious car crash, only to find herself trapped in a surreal world of her own making. As she navigates this haunting realm, she must confront the consequences of what she created… and try to escape it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This isn't just another shooter. It's a <strong>fully destructible, emotionally charged experience</strong> built for players who crave atmosphere, intensity, and meaning.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎬 <strong>Cinematic Storytelling</strong><br>Immerse yourself in a gripping narrative with high quality visuals and music, combining rich atmosphere and sci-fi in a way only bold indie games dare to explore.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧱 <strong>Total Environment Destruction</strong><br>Nearly every object, wall, and building can be blown apart. Use destruction creatively in combat. but beware: debris can harm you too.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900500/extras/28bbbc1b4ad5fbfb0db6f2c5651207c5.poster.avif?t=1757942072\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900500/extras/28bbbc1b4ad5fbfb0db6f2c5651207c5.webm?t=1757942072\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900500/extras/28bbbc1b4ad5fbfb0db6f2c5651207c5.mp4?t=1757942072\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⚔️ <strong>Epic Boss Battles</strong><br>Each boss fight is dynamic, unforgettable, and evolves the environment as you play. <strong>No reused ideas</strong>, no filler, just handcrafted moments that keep you on edge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900500/extras/59023439271812d44011a3d518e0a337.poster.avif?t=1757942072\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900500/extras/59023439271812d44011a3d518e0a337.webm?t=1757942072\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900500/extras/59023439271812d44011a3d518e0a337.mp4?t=1757942072\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎮 <strong>A Love Letter to Single Player Games</strong><br>Forget bloated open worlds with nothing to do. <i>Empty Space: The Creator</i> focuses on <strong>tight design</strong>, <strong>meaningful content</strong>, and <strong>pure player immersion</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900500/extras/53f7b93ad58c02bd7000ab0943e59956.poster.avif?t=1757942072\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900500/extras/53f7b93ad58c02bd7000ab0943e59956.webm?t=1757942072\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900500/extras/53f7b93ad58c02bd7000ab0943e59956.mp4?t=1757942072\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>If you’ve been missing the golden era of single-player shooters, this is for you.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready to explore. Destroy. Survive. And uncover the truth behind Sara’s digital prison.</p></li></ul>",
